Case 1: index skip scan that costs more, composite index first; result = sort plan over i_ta_cb     

===================================================
ca    cb    cc    
0     5     5000     
1     5     5001     
2     5     5002     

Query plan:
temp(order by)
    subplan: iscan
                 class: ta node[?]
                 index: i_ta_cb term[?]
                 cost:  ? card ?
    sort:  ? asc, ? asc
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select /*+ INDEX_SS */ ta.ca, ta.cb, ta.cc from ta ta where ta.cb= ?:?  order by ?, ? for orderby_num()<= ?:? 
